{
    "title": "Captions: For Talking Videos",
    "description": "Say it with a video\r\n\r\nCaptions revolutionizes video creation and editing with advanced AI, allowing you to create videos you\u2019re proud to share quickly and easily. Ideal for content creators, marketers, small businesses, and media agencies, Captions provides all the tools you need to create engaging, high-quality videos right from your phone. \r\n\r\nThe most accurate automatic captions and subtitles\r\n\u2022Automatic captions: Add customizable auto subtitles powered by cutting-edge speech recognition technology.\r\n\u2022Add static text to video: Enhance your content with easy text editing.\r\n\u2022Subtitle generation: Create eye-catching, dynamic word-by-word video subtitles.\r\n\u2022Generate Captions and Hashtags: Simplify editing for Instagram (IG captions), TikTok, YouTube, Shorts, and more.\r\n\r\nEdit and customize your content\r\n\u2022Wide range of caption templates: Choose from viral and classic caption styles.\r\n\u2022Customizable styles: Keep your content on-brand with customized colors and styles.\r\n\u2022Comprehensive video editor: Use Captions\u2019 full video editing suite of tools for X, Reels, IG Stories, Threads, and more.\r\n\r\nExpand your reach with translation and dubbing\r\n\u2022Multilingual dubbing: Automatically dub your content into 29+ languages in your own voice.\r\n\u2022Subtitle translation: Translate video subtitles into 29+ languages to grow your global audience.\r\n\u2022Accurate transcription: Transcribe spoken content to text for easy editing and translation.\r\n\r\nEnhance video quality with AI effects\r\n\u2022AI eye contact: Correct your eye contact even when reading from a script.\r\n\u2022AI zooms: Instantly add relevant zooms personalized to your content.\r\n\u2022AI sounds: Automatically generate relevant sounds for your videos.\r\n\u2022Video transition effects: Keep your videos engaging with smooth transitions.\r\n\u2022Template library: Select from an extensive library of trending templates and styles.\r\n\r\nCreate accessible content\r\n\u2022Create inclusive videos: With over 6% of the global population experiencing hearing loss, adding captions makes your videos inclusive and enjoyable for everyone.\r\n\u2022No more language barriers: Make your message accessible to a broader audience by dubbing your content into multiple languages, so you can grow your international audience.\r\n\u2022Support for noisy environments: Boost engagement with dynamic closed captions (cc), preferred by the 85% of viewers who watch videos without sound.\r\n\r\nWhy choose captions?\r\nTrusted by over 10M+ people, Captions offers the easiest way to create and edit talking videos with AI. Try Captions today.\r\n\r\nStart your free trial now.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.captions.ai/legal/terms\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.captions.ai/legal/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Say it with a video<br><br>Captions revolutionizes video creation and editing with advanced AI, allowing you to create videos you\u2019re proud to share quickly and easily. Ideal for content creators, marketers, small businesses, and media agencies, Captions provides all the tools you need to create engaging, high-quality videos right from your phone. <br><br>The most accurate automatic captions and subtitles<br>\u2022Automatic captions: Add customizable auto subtitles powered by cutting-edge speech recognition technology.<br>\u2022Add static text to video: Enhance your content with easy text editing.<br>\u2022Subtitle generation: Create eye-catching, dynamic word-by-word video subtitles.<br>\u2022Generate Captions and Hashtags: Simplify editing for Instagram (IG captions), TikTok, YouTube, Shorts, and more.<br><br>Edit and customize your content<br>\u2022Wide range of caption templates: Choose from viral and classic caption styles.<br>\u2022Customizable styles: Keep your content on-brand with customized colors and styles.<br>\u2022Comprehensive video editor: Use Captions\u2019 full video editing suite of tools for X, Reels, IG Stories, Threads, and more.<br><br>Expand your reach with translation and dubbing<br>\u2022Multilingual dubbing: Automatically dub your content into 29+ languages in your own voice.<br>\u2022Subtitle translation: Translate video subtitles into 29+ languages to grow your global audience.<br>\u2022Accurate transcription: Transcribe spoken content to text for easy editing and translation.<br><br>Enhance video quality with AI effects<br>\u2022AI eye contact: Correct your eye contact even when reading from a script.<br>\u2022AI zooms: Instantly add relevant zooms personalized to your content.<br>\u2022AI sounds: Automatically generate relevant sounds for your videos.<br>\u2022Video transition effects: Keep your videos engaging with smooth transitions.<br>\u2022Template library: Select from an extensive library of trending templates and styles.<br><br>Create accessible content<br>\u2022Create inclusive videos: With over 6% of the global population experiencing hearing loss, adding captions makes your videos inclusive and enjoyable for everyone.<br>\u2022No more language barriers: Make your message accessible to a broader audience by dubbing your content into multiple languages, so you can grow your international audience.<br>\u2022Support for noisy environments: Boost engagement with dynamic closed captions (cc), preferred by the 85% of viewers who watch videos without sound.<br><br>Why choose captions?<br>Trusted by over 10M+ people, Captions offers the easiest way to create and edit talking videos with AI. Try Captions today.<br><br>Start your free trial now.<br><br>Terms of Use: https://www.captions.ai/legal/terms<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.captions.ai/legal/privacy",
